"ui.18": "Driver",
"conduite-nuit-mauvais-temps.h1": "Driving at night or in bad weather",
"conduite-nuit-mauvais-temps.intro": "Night, rain or fog change everything: you see less, you brake later, and other drivers see you less well. The code requires specific lights and adapted speeds.",
"stationnement.c0.h": "1. Stopping or parking?",
"stationnement.c0.b": "<p><span class=\"fiche-highlight\">Stopping</span> is a short immobilisation, with the driver staying near the vehicle or on board (to drop someone off, for example). <span class=\"fiche-highlight\">Parking</span> is a prolonged immobilisation, with or without the driver.</p><p>A <span class=\"fiche-highlight\">solid</span> yellow line at the edge of the road forbids stopping and parking; a <span class=\"fiche-highlight\">dashed</span> yellow line forbids only parking (stopping remains possible).</p>",
"stationnement.c1.h": "2. Forbidden places",
"stationnement.c1.b": "<p>It is forbidden to stop or park, among other places:</p><ul><li>on a pedestrian crossing, and parking is forbidden on the 5 metres before it;</li><li>on a pavement, a cycle track, a bus lane;</li><li>at a bus stop or in front of a garage exit;</li><li>in a space reserved for disabled people without the card;</li><li>on a bend or at the top of a hill where visibility is poor, or double-parked.</li></ul><p>A vehicle may not remain in the same place on the public road for more than <span class=\"fiche-highlight\">7 consecutive days</span> (abusive parking).</p>",
"stationnement.c2.h": "3. Penalties and good habits",
"stationnement.c2.b": "<p>\"Obstructive\" parking is punished with a fine of <span class=\"fiche-highlight\">€35</span>; \"very obstructive\" parking (pavement, pedestrian crossing, cycle track, disabled space...) with <span class=\"fiche-highlight\">€135</span>, and the vehicle may be towed. In cities that have introduced it, paid parking replaces the fine with a \"post-parking charge\".</p><p>Before getting out, look behind you so you do not open the door in front of a cyclist or scooter. On streets with alternate parking, park on the odd-numbered side from the 1st to the 15th of the month and on the even-numbered side from the 16th to the end of the month.</p>",
