"assurance-accident.q4.r": "An offence",
"assurance-accident.q4.w": "A simple formality",
"assurance-accident.q4.t": "No insurance",
"assurance-accident.q4.q": "Driving without insurance is:",
"assurance-accident.f0.q": "Is car insurance compulsory?",
"assurance-accident.f0.a": "Yes, at least third-party liability, which covers damage caused to others.",
"assurance-accident.f1.q": "How soon must you report an accident?",
"assurance-accident.f1.a": "Within 5 working days, by sending the accident report form to your insurer.",
"assurance-accident.f2.q": "What is a hit-and-run offence?",
"assurance-accident.f2.a": "Leaving the scene of an accident to avoid responsibility: up to 3 years in prison and a €75,000 fine.",
"assurance-accident.h1": "Insurance and accidents: report, obligations and penalties",
"assurance-accident.intro": "Insurance, accident report, first aid: after an accident, several obligations apply. Knowing them avoids costly mistakes.",
